# #585: the SPA ships ONLY in the web-runner image (apps/web/dist, copied
# by that stage). apps/api/public is a host-native E2E artifact
# (scripts/e2e/run.sh syncs the built SPA next to the API for the E2E dev
# server) — it must never leak into the API image via the build context,
# or a local E2E run silently turns the API image back into an SPA origin.
apps/api/public

